flowchart LR
  subgraph CP[Control / Composition Plane]
    CK[Composition Kernel]
    MC[MusicComponent\nPlugin/Fiber]
    DP[Decoder Plugin]
    SP[SRC Plugin]
    GP[Gain Plugin]
    EP[EQ Plugin]
    AP[Analyzer Plugin]
    OP[AudioOutput Plugin]
    PTA[Processing Topology Authority]

    CK --> MC
    CK --> DP
    CK --> SP
    CK --> GP
    CK --> EP
    CK --> AP
    CK --> OP

    MC -. product/temporal control .-> DP
    MC -. product/temporal control .-> OP
    PTA -. builds/publishes direct PCM graph .-> DP
    PTA -. builds/publishes direct PCM graph .-> SP
    PTA -. builds/publishes direct PCM graph .-> GP
    PTA -. builds/publishes direct PCM graph .-> EP
    PTA -. builds/publishes direct PCM graph .-> AP
    PTA -. builds/publishes direct PCM graph .-> OP
  end

  subgraph DPTH[Direct-flow PCM Data Plane]
    DPE[Decoder endpoint]
    SPE[SRC endpoint]
    GPE[Gain endpoint]
    EPE[EQ endpoint]
    APE[Analyzer endpoint]
    OPE[AudioOutput endpoint]

    DPE -->|PCM + MediaSpan + provenance| SPE
    SPE -->|PCM| GPE
    GPE -->|PCM| EPE
    EPE -->|PCM| OPE
    EPE -->|PCM tap| APE
  end

  DP -. pre-bound endpoint .-> DPE
  SP -. pre-bound endpoint .-> SPE
  GP -. pre-bound endpoint .-> GPE
  EP -. pre-bound endpoint .-> EPE
  AP -. pre-bound endpoint .-> APE
  OP -. pre-bound endpoint .-> OPE

  NOTE1[Composition builds/lifetimes participants\nRealtime executes pre-bound graph]
  CK --- NOTE1
